{"version":1,"content":"<p>在日常的職場或生活中，我們總有機會聽到別人的稱讚，例如「你做得很好呀！</p><p>」、「不愧是你！</p><p>」等等。</p><p>當聽到這些讚美時，你通常會有甚麼感覺呢？</p><p>是會感到喜出望外、覺得理所當然，還是覺得口頭稱讚不夠實際？</p><p>其實，我們面對讚賞時的下意識反應，往往隱藏著我們</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-15T02:13:56.056243+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":125,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-15T02:00:42+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-15T02:07:15.536075+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-15T02:07:15.536075+00:00","content_hash":"3e22a720b5d46a78da6944eb0f469210254734ea2520d36dc708a9ddb0e6f1ec","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}